# Ustad AI Mobile Frontend Architecture & Data Orchestration Refactor

This document outlines the systematic refactor to execute the requested product lifecycle, data validation, and visual specifications across the mobile application.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> - The `providers.json` file will be imported directly from the backend folder relative to the mobile `src` directory (`../../../../Ustad_Backend/providers.json`). This ensures offline capability and instantaneous rendering.
> - `RegistrationScreen.js` will be largely bypassed since `SignupScreen.js` will directly handle writing Name and Location to Firestore. I will still retain it in the navigation stack as requested in Step 1, but typical flow will go Signup -> Firestore -> MainTabs.

