### Authentication & Validation Lifecycle
Cleaning up the UI and enforcing strict Firebase logic gates.

#### [MODIFY] [LoginScreen.js](file:///c:/Users/muham/OneDrive/Desktop/Ustad%20AI/mobile/src/screens/auth/LoginScreen.js)
- Remove all social login buttons (Google, Apple, WhatsApp).
- Update `handleLogin` to intercept Firebase auth errors (specifically `auth/user-not-found` or `auth/invalid-credential`).
- Display explicit alert: `"User not registered first! Please Sign Up."`
- Ensure successful login explicitly triggers `navigation.replace('MainTabs')`.

#### [MODIFY] [SignupScreen.js](file:///c:/Users/muham/OneDrive/Desktop/Ustad%20AI/mobile/src/screens/auth/SignupScreen.js)
